<title>PORTUGAL: Trade suspended in Credit Lyonnais Portugal unit.</title>
<headline>Trade suspended in Credit Lyonnais Portugal unit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) suspended trade in the local subsidiary of French bank Credit Lyonnais, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The suspension followed press reports that Spain's Caixa da Galicia was negotiating to buy the Portuguese bank.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
